menuconfig MODULES_RTCM_INJECTOR
	bool "rtcm_injector"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable RTCM Serial Injector module for external differential radio support.

		This module reads RTCM3 differential correction data from a serial port
		(typically connected to an external differential radio) and forwards it
		to the GPS module via the gps_inject_data uORB topic for RTK positioning.

		The module performs RTCM3 frame parsing with CRC-24Q validation and
		supports configurable serial port and baudrate via parameters:
		- RTCM_INJ_EN: Enable/disable module
		- RTCM_INJ_PORT: Serial port selection (TELEM1-4)
		- RTCM_INJ_BAUD: Baudrate configuration
